        "High-load bound: Xmax ≤ Dmax = 0.8 transactions/sec directly, since the bottleneck's service demand itself is the maximum throughput figure. Low-load bound at N = 4: X(4) ≤ N × (D+Z) = 4 × 9.4 = 37.6 transactions/sec.",
        "High-load bound: Xmax ≤ 1/(D+Z) = 1/9.4 ≈ 0.106 transactions/sec, combining both devices' demand with think time. Low-load bound at N = 4: X(4) ≤ Dmax/N = 0.8/4 = 0.2 transactions/sec.",
